# sparse-probe

Two runnable tasks among many parked ones. In `sparse_probe.rs`, `idle` tasks park on their first poll,
two tasks pass 2000 wakes back and forth, and then the last one wakes every parked task so the run
finishes. It prints rounds, polls, completed tasks and the median time of 101 runs, for 10, 100 and 1000
parked tasks.

Each folder runs it against one version of scope: `0.2.2`, `0.3.0` and `0.3.1` from crates.io, and the
commits `da655cf`, `c4fe22d` and `967b616` from GitHub. `Cargo.lock` pins each one.

    cd proofs/sparse-probe/0.3.1 && cargo run --release

Every version prints `rounds=1002`, and the same polls and completed counts:

    idle=10 rounds=1002 polls=2022 completed=12 median_us=…
    idle=100 rounds=1002 polls=2202 completed=102 median_us=…
    idle=1000 rounds=1002 polls=4002 completed=1002 median_us=…

The times depend on the machine. These are the `median_us` values from three runs of each version, taken
in turn, on one Apple Silicon Mac with other work running (2026-10-15):

| parked | 0.2.2 | 0.3.0 | da655cf | c4fe22d | 967b616 | 0.3.1 |
|---:|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 10 | 148.9, 159.2, 151.0 | 152.0, 153.2, 150.1 | 109.9, 109.5, 118.7 | 96.0, 96.2, 94.0 | 73.0, 72.9, 72.8 | 73.3, 72.5, 72.3 |
| 100 | 265.2, 269.9, 270.4 | 268.2, 263.8, 265.2 | 243.9, 246.8, 244.0 | 252.2, 253.7, 253.5 | 88.2, 88.3, 88.2 | 87.5, 88.2, 88.2 |
| 1000 | 1373.5, 1373.6, 1377.9 | 1368.9, 1382.9, 1368.1 | 1419.5, 1429.8, 1440.0 | 1965.6, 2003.8, 1967.8 | 237.3, 233.8, 233.9 | 231.6, 235.3, 236.4 |

The gap between `da655cf` and `c4fe22d` at 1000 parked moved a lot, so those two ran eight more times
each, taken in turn, on the same Mac later that day (2026-10-15, load average about 6). Each was built
once in its own fresh target dir, then:

    for v in da655cf c4fe22d; do (cd $v && cargo build --release --locked); done
    for i in 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8; do for v in da655cf c4fe22d; do $v/target/release/sparse_probe; done; done

`median_us`, runs 1 to 8:

| parked | version | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6 | 7 | 8 |
|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 10 | da655cf | 111.1 | 110.5 | 111.0 | 117.3 | 108.6 | 110.6 | 110.9 | 111.0 |
| 10 | c4fe22d | 94.8 | 96.1 | 96.0 | 94.0 | 97.0 | 93.0 | 95.5 | 97.1 |
| 100 | da655cf | 247.0 | 245.4 | 249.7 | 256.4 | 243.7 | 247.8 | 248.3 | 242.7 |
| 100 | c4fe22d | 254.0 | 256.2 | 253.8 | 238.0 | 236.9 | 253.3 | 236.3 | 250.7 |
| 1000 | da655cf | 1454.8 | 1449.3 | 1454.3 | 1461.0 | 1443.2 | 1450.4 | 1450.3 | 1455.1 |
| 1000 | c4fe22d | 1929.4 | 1750.7 | 1710.5 | 1717.3 | 1584.4 | 1691.2 | 1555.2 | 1715.4 |

At 1000, `c4fe22d` is slower in every run, by 7.2% to 32.6% run for run. At 100, `c4fe22d` is faster in
runs 4, 5 and 7 and slower in the rest. At 10, `c4fe22d` is faster in every run.
